{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b> mourns, etc.</b> The sense concerns the king of Assyria, who destroyed many kingdoms." "<b> fades.</b> From the nif'al pattern, like ונבקה רוח (Isaiah 19:3) and רחבה ונסבה (Ezekiel 41:7). It is also possible that the second נבלה is like נבול תבול (Exodus 18:18), from the qal pattern." "<b> the exalted ones.</b> The inhabitants of the heights of the earth."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:53.055560336Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}